      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Process was smooth, everything happened as planned and on time. Mitchell from Eureka Solar has taken many of my phone calls answering all of my questions. The education component of solar, Battery and Inverter sizing was great. Solar panels spread across three arrays with optimisers N,W & E. I went for a 10KW Inverter so that I could use the entire house instead of having to decide on which 2 circuits I used for a smaller inverter. I was going to replace an old solar system and Mitchell said no need to get rid of it. I opted for 5 modules of Battery giving me 16KW instead of the initial 3 modules being 10 KW. That was my choice. The system has room to expand with an additional 3 battery modules and I could double the amount of panels if I require it down the track. The work looked super neat and the inspector confirmed this. Mitchell attended the house to quote so there were no surprises. It was installed over a 2 day period by Mitchell no subcontractors which was really important to me. I recommend using Eureka Solar and Battery for a quality system, installation and service.",
